  "text": "G\n·\nGenesys AQM\nQUALITY INTELLIGENCE\nMONITOR\n◌\nOverview\nQUALITY\n◷\nEvaluations\n▥\nAnalytics\n◎\nCalibration\nCONFIGURATION\n◇\nPolicies\n▤\nEvaluation Forms\n▦\nQuestion Groups\n⚙\nSettings\nINTERACTIONS\n☷\nConversations\n◈\nConversation review\n✦\nPowered by Jev\n\nTyped AI decisions, shaped into clear quality signals.\n\nV0.17 OPERATIONAL OVERVIEW • 2026\nWorkspace / Forms\nREVIEWER\nJev managed securely by automation service\nCONFIGURATION\nEvaluation Forms\n\nPolicies pin published versions. Drafts can be tested without entering production analytics.\n\nTable\nCards\nStatus\nAll statuses\nDraft\nTesting\nPublished\nRetired\nVersion\nAll versions\nLatest version per family\nUsage\nAll usage\nAssigned to policy\nUnassigned\nSearch\n6 results\nForm name ↓\n\t\nStatus\n\t\nVersion\n\t\nQuestions\n\t\nAssigned policies\n\t\nServer evaluations\n\t\nServer avg score\n\t\nLast modified\n\nSales / Service Quality\tPUBLISHED\tv1\t5\t1\t0\t—\t—\nRetention / Cancellation\tPUBLISHED\tv1\t5\t1\t0\t—\t—\nGeneral Customer Service\tPUBLISHED\tv17\t3\t5\t8\t66%\t—\nCustomer Service - AI Scoring\tPUBLISHED\tv1\t9\t0\t0\t—\t—\nCompliance & Identity Verification\tPUBLISHED\tv1\t5\t2\t0\t—\t—\nComplaints Handling\tPUBLISHED\tv1\t5\t1\t0\t—\t—\nPUBLISHED · VERSION 17\nGeneral Customer Service\nExport JSON\n\nThis version's question and scoring definition is locked. Historical evaluations retain its snapshot.\n\nForm name\nDescription\nPass score\n70%\nCritical questions\nWarm opening\nUnderstanding the issue\nResolution\nQuestion groups\n\nQuestion weights determine the overall score. Read-only published definition.\n\nAdd group\nAdd reusable group\nOverall scoring\nQuestion weighted\nGroup weighted\n\nQuestion weighted combines applicable question credits. Group weighted combines group scores using their relative weights; configure a weight for every scoring group.\n\nYes threshold65%\nCustomer care\n↑\n↓\nDuplicate group\nDelete group\nGroup name\nGroup description\nGroup scoring\nUse group scoring settings\n01\nWarm opening\nYes / No\n\nDid the agent greet the customer and offer help at the start of the conversation?\n\nWeight 1 · Enabled · ID greeting\n\n↑\n↓\nRead only\n02\nUnderstanding the issue\nOrdered score\n\nHow effectively did the agent establish and acknowledge the customer’s actual issue?\n\nWeight 1.2 · Enabled · ID understanding\n\nPoor (poor · credit 0)\nAbsent or counterproductive behaviour.\nNeeds improvement (needs_improvement · credit 0.33)\nSome appropriate behaviour, with clear gaps.\nGood (good · credit 0.67)\nAppropriate and effective behaviour with minor gaps.\nExcellent (excellent · credit 1)\nConsistently clear, effective and considerate behaviour.\n↑\n↓\nRead only\n03\nResolution\nMultiple choice\n\nWhat is the best description of the issue outcome by the end of the conversation?\n\nWeight 1.5 · Enabled · ID resolution\n\nFully resolved (fully_resolved · credit 1)\nThe customer’s issue was resolved in the conversation.\nPartially resolved (partially_resolved · credit 0.5)\nMeaningful progress, but further action remains.\nUnresolved (unresolved · credit 0)\nThe issue remained unresolved with no meaningful progress.\nNot applicable (not_applicable · credit unscored)\nThe conversation does not present a resolvable issue.\n↑\n↓\nRead only\nAdd question",
